{"availability":"available","full":"thekaifansari01/Jarvis-OS-Agent","name":"Jarvis-OS-Agent","description":"An open-source autonomous AI OS Agent for Windows. Features zero line-drift coding, lifelong memory, Android ADB control, and proactive HITL.","category":"Developer tools","language":"Python","stars":10,"forks":4,"created":"2026-03-25T18:28:02Z","updated":"2026-10-15T13:45:56Z","license":"GPL-3.0","branch":"main","homepage":"https://jarvis-os-agent.vercel.app/","topics":["ai-agent","android-control","automation-tool","autonomous-agents","chromadb","code-editor","developer-tools","gemini-api","groq","llm","open-source","personal-assistant","python","voice-assistant","whatsapp-automation","windows-automation"],"demo":"https://jarvis-os-agent.vercel.app/","color":"#323057","ink":"#d6caff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-15T15:01:21.998Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-15T15:01:21.998Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-15T15:01:21.998Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-11T07:26:22.703Z","stars":10,"forks":3},{"at":"2026-10-15T15:01:21.998Z","stars":10,"forks":4}],"technologies":["Python"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["An AI Operating System that autonomously controls your PC, Android phone, local files, and lifelong memory — not just your code.","[]( []( []( []( []( []( []( []( []( []( []( []( []( []( []( []( [](LICENSE) []( []( [](","Most AI coding assistants stop at generating code. Most desktop assistants stop at opening apps. Jarvis is built on a different premise: an assistant should be able to see, act, remember, correct itself mid-task, and reach out — across your PC, your phone, and your communication channels — with one continuous mind."],"features":["It acts in the real world, not just in chat. Gmail, WhatsApp, Telegram, Google Calendar, Termux on your Android, file system, terminal, GUI mouse and keyboard — all native tools the agent chooses from autonomously.","It remembers for months, not minutes. A weighted property-graph memory layer with temporal decay, plus hybrid BM25 and vector RAG for your workspace documents.","It listens while it works. Live user corrections during a multi-step run are absorbed and re-planned without restarting — the agent loop is genuinely interruptible."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/thekaifansari01/Jarvis-OS-Agent/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"538e7ad622d6941af695977a5c0f3f467791ac0052bf1d308487c1c9f85b0222","extractedAt":"2026-10-15T15:01:22.136Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-15T15:01:22.136Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"An AI Operating System that autonomously controls your PC, Android phone, local files, and lifelong memory — not just your code.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/thekaifansari01/Jarvis-OS-Agent/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[{"kind":"account","status":"required","text":"> ⚠️ Note: Run memory, login, and reset commands with Jarvis stopped.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/thekaifansari01/Jarvis-OS-Agent/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"paid_service","status":"required","text":"Does wake word require an Azure subscription?","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/thekaifansari01/Jarvis-OS-Agent/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"api_key","status":"not_required","text":"Azure Custom Keyword detection runs fully on-device — the .table file is a one-time build from Speech Studio, and after that no API key or network call is needed for wake word detection.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/thekaifansari01/Jarvis-OS-Agent/blob/main/README.md"}],"fingerprint":"538e7ad622d6941af695977a5c0f3f467791ac0052bf1d308487c1c9f85b0222","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/thekaifansari01/Jarvis-OS-Agent/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-15T15:01:22.137Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-15T13:45:56Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/thekaifansari01/Jarvis-OS-Agent/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-15T15:01:22.138Z","hash":"538e7ad622d6941af695977a5c0f3f467791ac0052bf1d308487c1c9f85b0222","